OL,3,GNEWSAPetrol station murder was over
OL,4,Afeud, court hears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man was chased before being run over
OL,7,Fand killed by a car on a petrol station
OL,8,Fforecourt as part of a violent feud
OL,9,Fbetween two families, a court heard.
OL,11,FDaniel Ambler, 23, was crushed to death
OL,12,Fin January when he was thrown on to the
OL,13,Fbonnet of the car which then crashed
OL,14,Finto the petrol station's shop in
OL,15,FSeaham, County Durham.
OL,17,FBarry Anderson, 52, and his sons
OL,18,FAshton, 20, and Logan, 19, deny murder.
OL,19,FTwo 18-year-olds, Tyler Leadbetter and
OL,20,FAjay Henry, also deny murder.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
